            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "To add more detail I think it was caused by this API change in https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/39155:\n\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/4a0859631407bc9279a935f3219faabc0991a826/test/functional/vimscript/executable_spec.lua#L28-L29\n\nI think spawn should probably use an absolute native path resolver for the first element of the table (i.e., the executable).",
